⚠️ Phase 2: The "Final Mission" Checklist
While the masterinstaller.sh handles the heavy lifting, your server is not fully functional until the apps are linked. Complete these steps in order:
 * Secure the Command Center (ttyd):
   * Action: Open http://your-ip:7681.
   * Task: Log in to manage your server remotely.
 * Sync the "Arr" Empire (Prowlarr):
   * Action: Open http://your-ip:9696.
   * Task: Add your indexers and link Sonarr and Radarr via Settings > Apps.
 * Claim Your Library (Jellyfin & Jellyseerr):
   * Action: Open Jellyfin (8096) to create your libraries.
   * Action: Open Jellyseerr (5055) and sign in with Jellyfin to link your request automation.
 * Lock the Vault (External Storage):
   * Action: If you didn't do it during the install, run the vault mounter.
   * Task: Verify your drive is at /media/linux/Expansion.
