🔑 THE MASTER API KEY GUIDE
To make your media stack work as one unit, the apps must "talk" to each other using API keys.
1. Sonarr & Radarr API Keys
 * Where: Settings ➔ General ➔ Security.
 * Purpose: Allows Prowlarr and Jellyseerr to send movie/show requests.
2. Prowlarr API Key
 * Where: Settings ➔ General.
 * Purpose: Required to manage trackers from other apps.
3. Jellyfin API Key
 * Where: Administration ➔ Dashboard ➔ Advanced ➔ API Keys.
 * Purpose: Allows Jellyseerr to see your current library.
💡 PRO-TIPS FOR CONFIGURATION
 * Add a tabs folder for web UIs on your phone with your server's for quick access 
 * Copy/Paste Only: Never type these keys by hand to avoid connection errors.
 * Test the Connection: Always click the Test button in the app settings until you see a green checkmark before saving.
 * Download Pathing: In qBittorrent, ensure the save path is directed to your "Landing Zone" on /data/storage.
